<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@/~cl_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/name> "Seksyen 50 Akta ibu dipinda—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@/~cl_6__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@/~cl_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/msa@> .
